---
// Shared "invalid/private access" screen -- reused verbatim by both
// src/pages/index.astro (bare-domain access) and src/pages/404.astro
// (any unmatched route, including a /i/{slug}-{inviteId} whose exact
// combination was never generated -- see [invite].astro's own comment:
// a static build only ever produces the exact paths in guests.ts, so a
// mutated/guessed inviteId simply never matches a file and lands here
// through the host's normal 404 handling, same as any other bad path).
//
// Deliberately the SAME visual object as OrientationGate.astro/
// DesktopGate.astro, not a new design: same fixed full-viewport canvas,
// same paper texture, same centered composition, same Homemade Apple
// voice -- reuses their shared .orientation-lock/-content/-text rules
// (declared once in src/styles/global.css, including this component's
// own .not-found-gate display:flex trigger -- see that file's own
// comment for why it lives there and not in a component <style>) rather
// than a new stylesheet.
//
// Cover.astro is the only other place that currently loads this font
// (for its own use of .orientation-lock__text, among other things) --
// neither index.astro nor 404.astro render Cover, so without this import
// the shared .orientation-lock__text rule's `font-family: 'Homemade
// Apple', cursive` would silently fall back to the browser/OS's generic
// cursive font instead of the real one.
import '@fontsource/homemade-apple/400.css';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<div
  class="orientation-lock not-found-gate"
  style={`background-image: url('${base}/images/textura_vertical_2.png')`}
>
  <div class="orientation-lock__content">
    <h1 class="orientation-lock__text not-found-gate__title">Error 404: Variable No Encontrada 🖥️</h1>
    <p class="orientation-lock__text not-found-gate__body">
      ¡Ups! Parece que hay una anomalía en el sistema. Ningún modelo estadístico predijo que llegarías a la matriz
      principal sin tu variable específica.
    </p>
    <p class="orientation-lock__text not-found-gate__body">
      Para que el algoritmo funcione y puedas visualizar tu invitación, necesitas ingresar tu enlace completo.
    </p>
    <p class="orientation-lock__text not-found-gate__signoff">
      Compila bien los datos, ¡nos vemos en tu enlace personalizado!
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  /* Same 390-ish vertical canvas convention as every scene, so the text
     reads as a poster rather than stretching edge-to-edge on tablets. */
  .orientation-lock__content {
    max-width: 358.8px;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  /* Title: the primary element (per spec) -- same Homemade Apple family
     as the shared .orientation-lock__text, just scaled up and given the
     most weight/space, so it reads first. */
  .not-found-gate__title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 2.1rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .not-found-gate__body {
    font-size: 1.28rem;
    line-height: 1.42;
  }

  /* Sign-off: same family/size language as the body, set apart only by
     accent color -- reads as a closing line, not another instruction. */
  .not-found-gate__signoff {
    font-size: 1.28rem;
    line-height: 1.42;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
</style>
